title Dalaran Sewer Key (City of Dalaran key) (Completionist)
faction Horde
levels 33-35
category Dungeons
zone Alterac Mountains
pitch Dalaran Sewer Key: Opens the gate of the Horde's way into the City of Dalaran; one key opens it for the group. The Alliance walks in through the sewer pipe in Cantrips & Crows.
why Opens the gate of the Horde's way into the City of Dalaran; one key opens it for the group. The Alliance walks in through the sewer pipe in Cantrips & Crows.




